3. DORMANCY GRANT

If all of the following are true for a continuous period of twelve (12)
months, the Software becomes available for use and forking under the
terms in Section 4:

   (a) no commit, release, or tag has been published to the project's
       GitHub repository; and
   (b) no file or version update has been published to the project's
       CurseForge page and no file or version update has been published
       to the project's Modrinth page; and
   (c) the Author has not publicly stated that the project is paused,
       maintained, or otherwise still active.

The twelve month period is measured per project. Activity on other
projects by the Author does not reset it. Any qualifying activity listed
above resets the period to zero and ends any dormancy in progress, but
does not retroactively revoke work already lawfully published under
Section 4.

